#: scenario3:scenario3_DA535972_E041_4735_8200_774F92D43089
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2f0343182127566408f8966b1f95ee9e1130234d4562609c90246fd55b2d1cf0
